Diet, but not food type, significantly affects micronutrient and toxic
metal profiles in urine and/or plasma; a randomized, controlled
intervention trial
Leonidas Rempelos,1,2 Juan Wang,2,3,4 Marcin Barański,2,5 Anthony Watson,3 Nikolaos Volakakis,6 Catherine Hadall,7
Gultakin Hasanaliyeva,2,8 Eleni Chatzidimitriou,2,9 Amelia Magistrali,2 Hannah Davis,2 Vanessa Vigar,10
